 "solution": "判别式 \\(\\Delta=16+12=28>0\\)，方程有两个实数根，且 \\(x_{1}+x_{2}=-4\\)，\\(x_{1}x_{2}=-3\\)。\n\\(x_{1}^{2}+x_{2}^{2}=(x_{1}+x_{2})^{2}-2x_{1}x_{2}=16-2\\times(-3)=22\\)。",
